{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/279056-actual-play-promethean-new-dawn","id":279056,"title":"[Actual Play] Promethean - New Dawn","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-12T14:13:09-07:00","id":279056,"title":"[Actual Play] Promethean - New Dawn","content":"Hello everyone, with the recent invitation to play test 2nd edition of Promethean, I have gathered a group to play it. And with a more recent permission to post the write up for these games here, I decided to do it. Anyways, after our first game, I begin. This is an introduction of our Throng. I'll continue with the first session of our game pretty soon.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><i>Meeting the Throng.</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">John. He is a calm, thinking Promethean. Heavily investigating his condition, he has managed to get his hands on a couple of books, and also keeps copious amounts of notes and other information in the cloud. His tablet allows him to reach it quite easily. He finds it quite easy to understand human emotions, but lacks the capacity to actually feel them himself. He wants to be human, because they are free to experience the joys of the entire world.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Quickly after returning to life, he met Marv. Thinking that he must not be all alone in this world, and having his suspicions confirmed by the information he found, he set out to look for others like himself. Soon, he found Marv, drinking in a bar. Turns out, both of them were made quite recently, neither of them knows who is their maker.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Marv. He\u2019s 2.19 meter tall giant ball of muscles and force. If anything tries to stop him - he\u2019ll smash them until they give part. Soon after being made, he found hated and even being hunted by others, which led him to adopt a lifestyle of a brute. Learning to fight, he carries a crowbar with himself. However, he loses it quickly in combat prefering the personal fight of fists. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Marv also likes drinking. And in one of his drinking endeavours in a bar, he met a girl. Her name was Azian, and she was also a Promethean. Tho, she did not carry any scars, and was extraordinary beautiful. Her beauty was misleading, for she too, was a fighter. They had a fight, which Marv won. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Marv introduced Azian to John, and the three of them started to look for one man. John\u2019s investigation led him to track how his organs reached the hands of his creator. This research led them to San dan Glokta, one of their kind, who values beauty more than anything else. He can hardly understand it, tho, filling his time with cutting people to pieces and trying to figure out what makes them so beautiful. He's a monster, but he dreams of a day when he could be a gentleman. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Glokta was older than the other two, and so he taught them a bit more about their condition. Azothic memory helped them, but his guidance was invaluable. Soon they had to leave the city, and together they decided to move towards New London, Connecticut, feeling that the place has some more answers.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Next post: party goes to a new town, fight</span>s some pandorans, Marv picks another fight and... </span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":294,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","user":"Griautis","date":". 10-12-2014, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T17:14:29-07:00","id":279182,"title":"","content":"What lineages and refinements are each of the characters? (guessing Marv is a Frankenstein and Azian is a Galateid, but...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2826-mikerand","name":"mikerand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2826_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T02:39:08-07:00","id":279470,"title":"","content":"Marv - Frankenstein<br /> Azian - Galateid<br /> John - Tamuz<br /> Glokta - Frankenstein <br /> <br /> For refinements, can't post them yet, since I've never played Promethean 1e and I got no idea which ones were in it. (and refinement post didn't happen yet, as I'm only allowed to tell about stuff which was already publicly posted/is known)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T14:00:13-07:00","id":280111,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Arrival at New London</span></i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The group climbed out of the bus. It wasn\u2019t the most pleasant of journeys, but they were here. Firstly, they decided that they should rent out a place. Glokta had some money, so with Azian\u2019s help they found a small house for rent. After a couple of hours they met with an old lady, who suggested to show the small house around. Glokta said it wasn\u2019t needed, hurrying to pay and actually check the house out.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">After sorting the rent, Glokta and Azian got back to Marv and John. Together they got to the house, it was a nice house with plenty of room for everybody. After setting up in the house they decided to explore the area, hopefully finding whatever they came to the city for. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Soon they reached Williams Memorial Park, there they went through it checking out the statues. Glokta and Azian were oblivious, but John and Marv noticed that one of the statues started moving a little bit. Just as they shouted about it, the statue of a little boy jumped out of it\u2019s place and charged John. John managed to dodge the little monstrosity, which has now grown claws and giant teeth. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Marv started smashing down on the small monster with all his might, but the quick critter moved out of the way every time. Soon, the pandoran jumped upon john and digged in his organs, pulling them out and stuffing them down it\u2019s little mouth. Marv finally managed to hit the small thing, but the bruise it received quickly disappeared from it\u2019s body. After eating a few more organs of John it jumped off and started running out of the park. Marv gave chase but to no avail. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Meanwhile, Azian saw another statue waking up, she immediately grabbed the thing, and as it woke up tried to choke it down, but the critter seemed to be immune to it. As Azian held it, Glokta pulled out his hidden blade and stabbed the creature a couple of times, strangely, the wounds healed up in their own sight, with only most grievous ones leaving marks upon the Pandoran. After biting down upon Azian\u2019s hands, and after jumping out of her grasp he jumped on the old man Glokta, who was quickly robbed of his organs and of his Pyros, just like John.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Small sparks of electricity where jumping off Marv, as he was funneling his pyros and preparing to destroy the creature. After gathering all his might, he blasted a bolt of lighting at the creature, missing him, the electricity blasted outwards from Marv, destroying all the lamps in the park. After which the creature ran away as well, filled with Pyros. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">They have woken up these pandorans and now they knew that they will be back. Marv broke open one of the lamp posts, so that John could get his hands on some of the electricity flowing there. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">After this happenstance, Marv turned away to look for some bar, and the rest of the crew looked for an electricity station, hoping that it would have sufficient power for them without causing an outage. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">They found one, Glokta opened up the lock and once inside they managed to electrocute themselves to get rid of their wounds. The station barelly held up. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Meanwhile Marv found a bar, there he looked around finding the biggest dude inside. Without warning he punched him in the face, as the man was standing up, he grabbed his mug and threw it across the bar towards someone. Quickly his aggravated goons jumped on him and they wrestled, some too drunk good doers joined the fray trying to separate the fight. After delivering some more punches, and receiving quite a few of them himself, Marv ran out of the bar and got back home. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">After a short rest, and after John used some time to investigate pandorans in the notes he has collected, the group decided to go in an opposite direction of the park. While the pandorans posed a threat, they still had to figure out what exactly is drawing them in the city. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">As they went down the street, Glokta felt a source of azoth quite a few blocks away, they decided to investigate\u2026.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}